The second medium vendor returned a completed but invalid answer, so medium is now 0/2. One final distinct vendor remains; if it also fails, \(n=66\) is the shipping level and no manual retuning is needed.
diff --git a/gen_2506_23363.py b/gen_2506_23363.py
